/lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16204545</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1128/AEM.71.10.6247-6253.2005</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B5"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Xu</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Hsieh</surname><given-names>M-Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Narayanan</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Anderson</surname><given-names>WA</given-names></name><name><surname>Scharer</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Moo-Young</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Chou</surname><given-names>CP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cytoplasmic overexpression, folding, and processing of penicillin acylase precursor in <italic>Escherichia coli</italic></article-title><source>Biotechnol Prog</source><year>2005</year><volume>21</volume><fpage>1357</fpage><lpage>1365</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16209538</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1021/bp0501120</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Pan</surname><given-names>K-L</given-names></name><name><surname>Hsiao</surname><given-names>H-C</given-names></name><name><surname>Weng</surname><given-names>C-L</given-names></name><name><surname>Wu</surname><given-names>M-S</given-names></name><name><surname>Chou</surname><given-names>CP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Roles of DegP in prevention of protein misfolding in the periplasm upon overexpression of penicillin acylase in <italic>Escherichia coli</italic></article-title><source>J Bacteriology</source><year>2003</year><volume>185</volume><fpage>3020</fpage><lpage>3030</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1128/JB.185.10.3020-3030.2003</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hunt</surname><given-nam