gan</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Moody</surname><given-names>PCE</given-names></name><name><surname>Hubbard</surname><given-names>RE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Ligand-induced conformational change in penicillin acylase</article-title><source>J Mol Biol</source><year>1998</year><volume>284</volume><fpage>463</fpage><lpage>475</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9813130</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1006/jmbi.1998.2180</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sio</surname><given-names>CF</given-names></name><name><surname>Quax</surname><given-names>WJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Improved &#x003b2;-lactam acylases and their use as industrial biocatalysts</article-title><source>Curr Opin Biotechnol</source><year>2004</year><volume>15</volume><fpage>349</fpage><lpage>355</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15358003</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.copbio.2004.06.006</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bruggink</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Roos</surname><given-names>EC</given-names></name><name><surname>de Vroom</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Penicillin acylase in the industrial production of &#x003b2;-lactam antibiotics</article-title><source>Org Process Res Dev</source><year>1998</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>128</fpage><lpage>133</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1021/op9700643</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fuganti</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Rosell</surname><given-names>CM</given-names></name><name><surname>Rigoni</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Servi</surname><given-names>